Author: Nick Hung <nick@andestech.com>
Date:   Sat Jun 27 22:28:53 2026 +0800

    Andes V5 CSR transport: restore + re-drain (v3 ABI)

    Behavioral. ResumeDriver restores the Andes CSR block when HYBRID_FLAG_ANDES is set (X-macro write_csr_tolerant loop + PMA, every pmaaddr before any pmacfg, mirroring the PMP ordering); StateDrain re-reads it at the exit halt so in-ROI writes reach the drained state. Bumps external/andesim_abi to the v3 commit. Unit tests cover restore, re-read, and ABI layout.

    Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

diff --git a/src/hybrid/resume_driver.hpp b/src/hybrid/resume_driver.hpp
